<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>跋 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%B7%8B/</link><description>Recent content in 跋 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 15:15:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%B7%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>跋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/7-1-ba/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 15:11:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/7-1-ba/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;我已传完。汝另抄一本，存之《医述》之中，以成全书。他年刊布天下，传之万年，以见吾道之大，亦快事也。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;雷公真君传于燕市，时康熙戊辰七月晦日也。我无他言，但愿汝修道，以答上帝之心也。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>